ect Go pseudo-versions as dev in upgrade-path check"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"8cc7a137f0d02a11a52e50425db033c169835e90","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDhjYzdhMTM3ZjBkMDJhMTFhNTJlNTA0MjVkYjAzM2MxNjk4MzVlOTA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/8cc7a137f0d02a11a52e50425db033c169835e90","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/8cc7a137f0d02a11a52e50425db033c169835e90","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-26T13:55:07Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-26T13:55:07Z"},"tree":{"sha":"ba7f3ed8726a6630f17c7a256b5d8d6fae75efc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/ba7f3ed8726a6630f17c7a256b5d8d6fae75efc5"},"message":"db: treat Go module pseudo-versions as dev builds\n\nUntagged main-sha builds inherit a Go module pseudo-version from\nruntime/debug.BuildInfo (vX.Y.Z-<timestamp>-<hash>). isDev only\nfiltered \"\", \"dev\", and \"(devel)\", so the pseudo-version was stored\nin database_versions and the next real release tripped the\nmulti-minor upgrade guard:\n\n    headscale version v0.29.0-beta.1 cannot be used with a database\n    last used by v0.0.0-20260520093041-e4e742c776ee, upgrading more\n    than one minor version at a time is not supported\n\nAdd pseudoVersionTime, a regex + time.Parse predicate covering all\nthree Go pseudo-version forms (v0.0.0 base, pre-release ancestor,\nrelease ancestor), and delegate from isDev. The dev gate at\ndb.go:790 already prevents pseudo-versions from being written, so\nalready-poisoned databases self-heal on the next real-release start.\n\nFixes #3281","parents":[{"sha":"4483fd0cad38717913e7509fc50f9d48c691b02b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/4483fd0cad38717913e7509fc50f9d48c691b02b","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/4483fd0cad38717913e7509fc50f9d48c691b02b"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"rea